ever built, and the largest monument of

17
00:00:37,536 --> 00:00:38,200
any kind.

18
00:00:38,550 --> 00:00:40,786
It was built in stages over about

19
00:00:40,786 --> 00:00:43,496
a thousand years, starting more than two

20
00:00:43,496 --> 00:00:46,410
thousand years ago, each new layer covering

21
00:00:46,410 --> 00:00:47,019
the last.

22
00:00:47,369 --> 00:00:50,127
By the time the Spanish arrived in

23
00:00:50,127 --> 00:00:53,291
the fifteen hundreds, it was covered in

24
00:00:53,291 --> 00:00:56,292
earth and plants. In 1594, they built

25
00:00:56,292 --> 00:00:59,131
the church of Nuestra Señora de los

26
00:00:59,131 --> 00:01:00,916
Remedios right on top.

27
00:01:01,266 --> 00:01:04,032
Today, you can walk through tunnels dug

28
00:01:04,032 --> 00:01:07,152
